XQ7 N_RL3 INJ N_Q9E 0 sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00
XQ8 N_RL3 X2_B N_Q10E 0 sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00
XQ9 N_RL4 X2 N_Q9E 0 sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00
XQ10 N_RL4 INJ_B N_Q10E 0 sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00
